    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586480/extras/96e5d7cfc2cab34652b65857df326b98.avif?t=1752493483\" data-has-big width=800 height=254 /></span>Embark on a thrilling adventure of exploration and survival in <i>Bling: Fortune Memories</i>, a platformer and action game set in a mysterious abandoned temple. Play as a young adventurer searching for his lost brother, who vanished while trying to collect the temple\u2019s legendary gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586480/extras/05b5924ecdaa5db478e552c0cc6924b9.poster.avif?t=1752493483\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586480/extras/05b5924ecdaa5db478e552c0cc6924b9.webp?t=1752493483\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586480/extras/3b1735471e3e4b8274e5b11820d3e1b2.webp?t=1752493483\" width=759 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic exploration:</strong> Move on a 2D grid through an environment filled with traps, enemies, and hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invisibility power:</strong> Use the Medallion\u2019s power to temporarily become invisible and evade deadly dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and challenges:</strong> Each level introduces new mechanics and obstacles that will test your wits and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist art style:</strong> A simple, geometric visual style that enhances the strategic gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection-based progression:</strong> Find and gather gems to unlock new levels and advance the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586480/extras/3b1735471e3e4b8274e5b11820d3e1b2.webp?t=1752493483\" width=759 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you overcome the temple\u2019s challenges and rescue your brother before it\u2019s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586480/extras/edf640f7d98e520892a36ac02dbd4598.avif?t=1752493483\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586480/extras/96e5d7cfc2cab34652b65857df326b98.avif?t=1752493483\" data-has-big width=800 height=254 /></span>Embark on a thrilling adventure of exploration and survival in <i>Bling: Fortune Memories</i>, a platformer and action game set in a mysterious abandoned temple. Play as a young adventurer searching for his lost brother, who vanished while trying to collect the temple\u2019s legendary gems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586480/extras/05b5924ecdaa5db478e552c0cc6924b9.poster.avif?t=1752493483\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586480/extras/05b5924ecdaa5db478e552c0cc6924b9.webp?t=1752493483\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=76 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586480/extras/3b1735471e3e4b8274e5b11820d3e1b2.webp?t=1752493483\" width=759 height=25 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic exploration:</strong> Move on a 2D grid through an environment filled with traps, enemies, and hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invisibility power:</strong> Use the Medallion\u2019s power to temporarily become invisible and evade deadly dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and challenges:</strong> Each level introduces new mechanics and obstacles that will test your wits and reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist art style:</strong> A simple, geometric visual style that enhances the strategic gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection-based progression:</strong> Find and gather gems to unlock new levels and advance the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586480/extras/3b1735471e3e4b8274e5b11820d3e1b2.webp?t=1752493483\" width=759 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you overcome the temple\u2019s challenges and rescue your brother before it\u2019s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586480/extras/edf640f7d98e520892a36ac02dbd4598.avif?t=1752493483\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Explore a temple filled with traps and secrets in Bling: Fortune Memories. Use your wits, collect gems, and activate your invisibility ability to overcome challenges while searching for your missing brother. With tactical grid-based movement and a minimalist style, will you achieve fortune?",
